# SET_CONFIGURATION of register 0020h, and its ACCEPT response.
#
# Transcribed byte for byte from tests/vectors/espi_dump.txt, lines 30-43.
#
# Command carries the DWord, response carries only the status trailer -- the
# mirror image of GET_CONFIGURATION. Figure 23, p.37.
CMD 22 00 20 01 00 07 00 01
TAR
RSP 08 0F 01 95
